OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 2 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Icons of
OL,5,     FBritish Light Music
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod explores the
OL,7,     Gcomposers who fought to keep
OL,8,     Glight music alive in the wake of
OL,9,     Gdramatic shifts in the social
OL,10,     Glives of people in Britain.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GJames Murphy and Katie Derham
OL,13,     Glook ahead to key cultural
OL,14,     Ghighlights in 2026.
OL,15,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,16,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,18,     GIncluding music by Tchaikovsky,
OL,19,     GWilliam Grant Still and Randall
OL,20,     GThompson.
